{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-preethi-blue-leaf-mixer-grinders-2508-0081","content_id":"364d7381-e5de-4357-9b63-d0696112d984","description":"Product Safety Report for Preethi Blue Leaf Mixer Grinders presenting a high risk of electric shock and fire.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"7ab0ed68-4d82-44bc-932f-a3cb12ee1bdb","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-12-22T16:18:26+00:00","id":"7ab0ed68-4d82-44bc-932f-a3cb12ee1bdb","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-12-22T16:18:26+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69496f52033693d5d50eb8b9/2508-0081-product-safety-report-preethi-blue-leaf-mixer-grinders.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Preethi Blue Leaf Mixer Grinders</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a high risk of electric shock as it is supplied with a clover-leaf plug. Additionally, the lack of a fuse means the product is inadequately earthed, presenting a risk of fire under fault conditions.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Kitchen/cooking accessories - Kitchen Combination Mixing/Blending/Chopping Appliances</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Preethi</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model numbers</td>\n      <td>MG150, MG149</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Listing names</td>\n      <td>Blue Leaf Gold Mixer Grinder 700W, Preethi Blue Leaf Silver Mixer Grinder 600W</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Sri Lanka</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Blue and white mixer grinders with accessories and black power supply cord with clover leaf-style plug.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_7ab0ed68-4d82-44bc-932f-a3cb12ee1bdb\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69496f52033693d5d50eb8b9/2508-0081-product-safety-report-preethi-blue-leaf-mixer-grinders.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a high risk of electric shock as it is supplied with a clover-leaf plug. If a consumer were to plug the product into a socket, the consumer could gain access to the live parts and receive an electric shock. Additionally, the lack of a fuse means the product is inadequately earthed, presenting a risk of fire under fault conditions. The product was also missing the required markings and documentation.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016 or the Plugs and Sockets etc. (Safety) Regulations 1994.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2508-0081</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-23T09:07:02Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"kitchen-cooking-accessories","product_measure_type":["import-rejected-at-border"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-12-23","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_typ